{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a0bb9aa9dc5a833d8e31","chatId":"0080079ccb30480db3affd88d567f1d5","sessionId":null,"userId":98557,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"C\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"C\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1056,"promptTokens":1504,"completionTokens":57,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:23"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005908684611833427,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0bb9aa9dc5a833d8e30","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482363368,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:23","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a0bb9aa9dc5a833d8e30","chatId":"0080079ccb30480db3affd88d567f1d5","sessionId":null,"userId":98557,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n约翰邀请朋友马克和艾丽斯来游戏之夜。马克来早了，在约翰准备时，他看到了墙上的抽象画。马克不知道这是约翰自己创作的，说这看起来像是小孩子画的。艾丽斯对这些画很熟悉，沉默地对约翰投以知情的目光。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，艾丽斯最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 开心\nB) 没意识的\nC) 尴尬\nD) 爱护\nE) 愧疚\nF) 紧张\n\n## 问题 2\n艾丽斯为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 她明白马克的评价会让约翰不高兴\nB) 她知道约翰会欣赏早到的玩家\nC) 她认为抽象艺术品是一件杰作\nD) 她喜欢在游戏之夜的友好竞争。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005908684611833427,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0bb9aa9dc5a833d8e31","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482363366,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:23","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"ad772d064d714e08b5a534a085206bbe"}